  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": 'The Steam Seperator is a machine that uses steam to spin §4impure dusts§r into §auseable dusts§r. Also wonderfully pairs with the steam grinder and is why they are often used together.

A major benefit to steam multiblocks is that they §bparallel§r recipes. This lets you run recipes many times faster than even your electric machines can handle. With this, you should be running these multis §6well into late HV§r.


Because of this, its time to spin, spin, spin.



---



"You find the traditional method of sieving resources §acalming and relaxing§r, however it has started to cost a §ctoll on your health§r. Deciding to §9not harm yourself further§r, you ponder a §anew way to separate items, a way to sieve them§r.

You think about the other machines you\'ve created and decide to put to use your §3steam§r. You design a machine with hundreds of tiny holes in a chamber with a slotted bottom leading to separate boxes on a grid pattern.

It shoots steam at §dhigh speeds§r around the machine in such a manner it separates the resources similar to how people use to §6pan for gold§r."',
